      "summaries": {
        "en": "Claude-Code-Telegram is a Python-based Telegram bot that enables developers to remotely access Claude Code's AI coding assistance from anywhere, solving the problem of being tied to specific development environments. Its technical innovation lies in maintaining persistent coding sessions through Telegram's messaging platform, allowing continuous project interactions even when switching devices. Developers can integrate it into their workflow by setting up the bot to receive AI-powered code suggestions, debugging help, and project management assistance directly in Telegram chats, making it particularly useful for mobile coding sessions or quick consultations during commutes.",
        "zh": "Claude-Code-Telegram 是一个基于 Python 的 Telegram 机器人，它让开发者能够通过手机或任何设备远程访问 Claude Code 的 AI 编程助手，解决了开发环境受地点限制的问题。该项目通过 Telegram 的消息平台实现持久化编码会话，即使切换设备也能保持项目对话的连续性，这种设计让移动端编程变得更加流畅。开发者可以将其配置为接收代码建议、调试帮助和项目管理支持，特别适合在通勤途中进行快速编码咨询或利用碎片时间推进项目，为分布式团队和移动办公场景提供了实用的 AI 辅助工具。",
        "es": "Claude-Code-Telegram is a Python-based Telegram bot that enables developers to remotely access Claude Code's AI coding assistance from anywhere, solving the problem of being tied to specific development environments. Its technical innovation lies in maintaining persistent coding sessions through Telegram's messaging platform, allowing continuous project interactions even when switching devices. Developers can integrate it into their workflow by setting up the bot to receive AI-powered code suggestions, debugging help, and project management assistance directly in Telegram chats, making it particularly useful for mobile coding sessions or quick consultations during commutes.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "claude-code-telegram gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Claude-Code-Telegram is a Python-based Telegram bot that enables developers to remotely access Claude Code's AI coding assistance from anywhere, solving the problem of being tied to specific development environments. Its technical innovation lies in maintaining persistent coding sessions through Telegram's messaging platform, allowing continuous project interactions even when switching devices. Developers can integrate it into their workflow by setting up the bot to receive AI-powered code suggestions, debugging help, and project management assistance directly in Telegram chats, making it particularly useful for mobile coding sessions or quick consultations during commutes.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/RichardAtCT/claude-code-telegram for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
