      "summaries": {
        "en": "Open-Mercato is a TypeScript-based CRM/ERP foundation framework designed to accelerate development of business applications by providing modular, extensible building blocks. Its technical strength lies in combining strong default configurations with complete customization capabilities, enabling teams to avoid vendor lock-in while maintaining enterprise-grade reliability. Developers can use it as a foundation for R&D projects, operational tools, or growth platforms, extending its AI-supportive architecture to create tailored solutions that evolve with business needs.",
        "zh": "Open-Mercato是一个基于TypeScript的CRM/ERP基础框架，旨在通过提供模块化、可扩展的构建块来加速商业应用的开发。其技术核心在于将强大的默认配置与完全自定义能力相结合，使团队既能获得开箱即用的功能，又能根据具体需求深度定制，避免了供应商锁定问题。该框架特别适合需要快速构建研发工具、运营系统或增长平台的团队，开发者可以基于其AI支持架构创建适应业务演变的定制化解决方案，实现从原型到生产环境的平滑过渡。",
        "es": "Open-Mercato is a TypeScript-based CRM/ERP foundation framework designed to accelerate development of business applications by providing modular, extensible building blocks. Its technical strength lies in combining strong default configurations with complete customization capabilities, enabling teams to avoid vendor lock-in while maintaining enterprise-grade reliability. Developers can use it as a foundation for R&D projects, operational tools, or growth platforms, extending its AI-supportive architecture to create tailored solutions that evolve with business needs.",
        "sections": {
