          "what": "Open-Mercato is a TypeScript-based CRM/ERP foundation framework designed to accelerate development of business applications by providing modular, extensible building blocks. Its technical strength lies in combining strong default configurations with complete customization capabilities, enabling teams to avoid vendor lock-in while maintaining enterprise-grade reliability. Developers can use it as a foundation for R&D projects, operational tools, or growth platforms, extending its AI-supportive architecture to create tailored solutions that evolve with business needs.",
